/E (The program engaged approximately 130 participants, equipping them with essential skills in Pre-Tender Preparation and Planning, Crafting Comprehensive and Persuasive Tender Responses, Construction Project Finance Fundamentals, and Financial Risk Management. These sessions not only empowered our members but also reinforced our commitment to advancing industry standards and best practices.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
