/E (This training was designed to prepare contractors for success in the tendering process. It equips them with the critical skills needed to align their organizational capabilities with project requirements, mitigate risks, and develop strategic approaches to bid preparation. Additionally, the inclusion of tax compliance and bank financing expectations ensures a well-rounded understanding of the pre-tender phase, enabling contractors to build competitive and sustainable business models.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
