/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To equip contractors with a practical approach to estimating and tendering, enabling them to effectively manage price and performance risks inherent in construction projects. This training will provide insights into best practices for pricing tenders, ensuring accuracy and competitiveness in both public and private sector contracts. Participants will gain a deeper understanding of estimating principles, tendering methods, and risk mitigation strategies applicable to projects of all sizes and complexities.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
